OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, arrested over stabbing at
OL,4,ABrent Council HQ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder after a young man
OL,8,Fwas found fatally stabbed in a building
OL,9,Fwhich houses Brent Council's
OL,10,Fheadquarters and a library.
OL,12,FEmergency services were called at about
OL,13,F14:30 BST on Tuesday to Brent Civic
OL,14,FCentre, near Wembley Stadium in
OL,15,Fnorth-west London, where the victim was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FPolice said he had not yet been
OL,19,Fformally identified but he is believed
OL,20,Fto be 17-year-old David Wynter.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
